1
00:00:29,530 --> 00:00:31,017
Hello?

2
00:00:31,697 --> 00:00:33,349
Hello.

3
00:00:34,790 --> 00:00:36,443
<i>Did you get home?</i>

4
00:00:37,055 --> 00:00:38,303
Yeah.

5
00:00:39,241 --> 00:00:41,451
I just got in.

6
00:00:45,552 --> 00:00:46,886
Welcome home.

7
00:00:50,623 --> 00:00:52,383
Thank you.

8
00:00:56,299 --> 00:00:57,597
<i>Well...</i>

9
00:00:59,738 --> 00:01:03,831
It's kind of hard
to come up with stuff to say.

10
00:01:04,488 --> 00:01:06,329
Oh, that's true.

11
00:01:06,329 --> 00:01:09,941
Maybe I can think of a funny story.

12
00:01:09,941 --> 00:01:11,888
<i>That's not what I mean.</i>

13
00:01:15,246 --> 00:01:17,718
I get nervous around my girlfriend.

14
00:01:21,299 --> 00:01:23,046
Girlfriend?

15
00:01:25,165 --> 00:01:26,965
<i>That's you, right?</i>

16
00:01:33,213 --> 00:01:34,433
Yeah.

17
00:01:44,888 --> 00:01:45,900
Morning.

18
00:01:45,900 --> 00:01:47,540
Morning.

19
00:02:03,423 --> 00:02:05,029
Nagi.

20
00:02:06,462 --> 00:02:07,689
What?

21
00:02:09,838 --> 00:02:14,235
Yesterday, Taguchi and I...

22
00:02:17,850 --> 00:02:20,307
We started dating.

23
00:02:24,770 --> 00:02:31,024
I was able to properly
put a name to my feelings.

24
00:02:34,029 --> 00:02:35,609
I see.

25
00:02:40,369 --> 00:02:41,937
Nagi?

26
00:02:43,872 --> 00:02:47,630
I've always been so worried about you.

27
00:02:48,354 --> 00:02:51,378
I see, that's great.

28
00:02:52,884 --> 00:02:55,039
Leave the wedding to me.

29
00:02:55,039 --> 00:02:58,051
I'll do your hair and makeup.
Want multiple outfits?

30
00:02:58,051 --> 00:03:02,002
Wait, it's too soon to talk about marriage.

31
00:03:02,002 --> 00:03:04,195
I see. An office romance, huh?

32
00:03:04,978 --> 00:03:07,031
That's nice.

33
00:03:08,699 --> 00:03:11,123
<i>An office romance...</i>

34
00:03:52,031 --> 00:03:55,529
[Should we act as we usually do at work?]

35
00:04:00,903 --> 00:04:03,790
I wanted to ask for final confirmation
on this UI image.

36
00:04:03,790 --> 00:04:05,029
Sure.

37
00:04:08,670 --> 00:04:10,096
Taguchi.

38
00:04:10,096 --> 00:04:11,710
Good morning!

39
00:04:12,528 --> 00:04:14,307
Good morning.

40
00:04:14,307 --> 00:04:16,048
Sorry, Mr. Taguchi.

41
00:04:16,048 --> 00:04:18,292
No, I'm sorry, Ms. Yamane.

42
00:04:27,590 --> 00:04:28,937
Morning.

43
00:04:28,937 --> 00:04:30,931
Good morning.

44
00:04:33,517 --> 00:04:35,017
The date.

45
00:04:36,643 --> 00:04:38,363
How did it go?

46
00:04:49,131 --> 00:04:51,849
I have something to report.

47
00:04:54,437 --> 00:04:57,471
We've started dating.

48
00:04:57,471 --> 00:05:00,278
Huh? What?

49
00:05:01,566 --> 00:05:02,906
Yes.

50
00:05:03,795 --> 00:05:07,711
You were able to figure out
your own feelings.

51
00:05:08,678 --> 00:05:10,692
You did great.

52
00:05:10,692 --> 00:05:13,878
It's really thanks to you, Ms. Ohata.

53
00:05:13,878 --> 00:05:17,593
All I did was lend you an ear.

54
00:05:17,593 --> 00:05:22,681
The one who listened to my struggles
was you, Ms. Ohata.

55
00:05:23,840 --> 00:05:26,858
If I had kept worrying about it alone,

56
00:05:26,858 --> 00:05:30,596
I don't know
if I could've found an answer.

57
00:05:32,502 --> 00:05:37,697
I'm really glad you were there, Ms. Ohata.

58
00:05:40,718 --> 00:05:45,565
And so, I want to thank you somehow.

59
00:05:48,307 --> 00:05:52,470
Then, I have a request.

60
00:05:53,280 --> 00:05:54,553
Okay.

61
00:05:59,622 --> 00:06:02,612
Tell me all about your romance.

62
00:06:03,245 --> 00:06:07,197
Huh? Is that really a way to thank you?

63
00:06:07,197 --> 00:06:09,357
Yeah. Of course.

64
00:06:14,418 --> 00:06:17,097
Ms. Ohata, you smiled!

65
00:06:20,205 --> 00:06:21,995
You promised, okay?

66
00:06:23,884 --> 00:06:25,144
Yes.

67
00:06:39,678 --> 00:06:41,802
Are you kind of tired?

68
00:06:41,802 --> 00:06:45,142
Yeah, a little.

69
00:06:46,323 --> 00:06:50,465
Oh, you couldn't focus on work?

70
00:06:51,718 --> 00:06:54,706
No, well... that's...

71
00:06:58,542 --> 00:07:00,455
I couldn't focus either, you know?

72
00:07:12,933 --> 00:07:17,885
This morning, I told Ms. Ohata about us.

73
00:07:17,885 --> 00:07:20,544
She's been giving me a lot of advice.

74
00:07:21,195 --> 00:07:23,247
I see.

75
00:07:23,247 --> 00:07:24,408
Yeah.

76
00:07:25,555 --> 00:07:27,792
Did Ms. Ohata say anything?

77
00:07:29,004 --> 00:07:31,130
She said I did great.

78
00:07:31,130 --> 00:07:36,293
And that she wants to hear
about our romance.

79
00:07:36,293 --> 00:07:38,078
Our romance?

80
00:07:38,078 --> 00:07:39,597
Yeah.

81
00:07:39,597 --> 00:07:42,951
Well, I want to hear about that too.

82
00:07:42,951 --> 00:07:44,204
Huh?

83
00:07:49,780 --> 00:07:51,312
Hey, can't think of anything?

84
00:07:51,312 --> 00:07:54,365
No, that's not it.

85
00:07:54,365 --> 00:07:59,108
Once I start talking,
I won't be able to stop.

86
00:08:03,793 --> 00:08:08,337
Sorry for saying weird things.
It's just, my heart's been...

87
00:08:12,826 --> 00:08:14,227
I see.

88
00:08:20,083 --> 00:08:21,711
But...

89
00:08:23,605 --> 00:08:27,034
I'm filled with happiness.

90
00:08:33,638 --> 00:08:37,725
I'm really glad that I realized

91
00:08:40,057 --> 00:08:44,000
that I like you, Taguchi.

92
00:09:13,918 --> 00:09:15,688
- You said something like that?
- Yeah.

93
00:09:15,688 --> 00:09:17,699
- You didn't know?
- I had no idea.

94
00:09:39,706 --> 00:09:41,619
Should we get going soon?

95
00:09:43,640 --> 00:09:44,808
Huh?

96
00:09:47,694 --> 00:09:49,937
Taguchi.

97
00:09:49,937 --> 00:09:51,911
We're at work.

98
00:09:52,551 --> 00:09:53,637
Yeah.

99
00:09:55,003 --> 00:09:56,542
I know.

100
00:09:58,506 --> 00:10:00,416
I know, but...

101
00:10:24,333 --> 00:10:25,746
Why?

102
00:10:28,795 --> 00:10:30,909
Because we're at work.

103
00:10:33,065 --> 00:10:34,545
Is that all?

104
00:10:37,836 --> 00:10:44,315
I won't be able to go back in
with a normal face, so we can't.

105
00:10:48,607 --> 00:10:51,427
Maybe next time...

106
00:11:04,791 --> 00:11:07,279
Remember, you said "next time".

107
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:25,846
Hey, next time,
can I introduce you to my friend?

108
00:11:26,833 --> 00:11:28,277
Your friend?

109
00:11:28,277 --> 00:11:31,641
Yeah. The guy I was closest to in college.

110
00:11:31,641 --> 00:11:34,116
I've told him about you.

111
00:11:35,004 --> 00:11:38,332
What did you tell him about me?

112
00:11:43,275 --> 00:11:44,756
I forgot.

113
00:11:47,623 --> 00:11:51,221
But when I said we're dating,
he said he wants to meet you.

114
00:11:54,237 --> 00:11:56,927
Oh, it's okay if you say no.

115
00:11:58,890 --> 00:12:01,737
Sure, I want to meet him too.

116
00:12:03,432 --> 00:12:05,093
I'm Inooka.

117
00:12:07,324 --> 00:12:09,237
I'm Taiki Inooka.

118
00:12:11,189 --> 00:12:13,239
I'm Shiori Yamane.

119
00:12:13,239 --> 00:12:15,052
Nice to meet you today.

120
00:12:17,527 --> 00:12:19,135
What's with that reaction?

121
00:12:19,135 --> 00:12:21,434
Huh? Well...

122
00:12:22,319 --> 00:12:24,735
She talks in her sleep?

123
00:12:26,813 --> 00:12:28,130
Don't say stupid things.

124
00:12:28,130 --> 00:12:30,450
It's not stupid.

125
00:12:31,736 --> 00:12:34,213
I'm looking forward to this.

126
00:12:36,898 --> 00:12:41,308
We're gonna have a good, long talk today.

127
00:12:47,937 --> 00:12:50,130
Oh, man!

128
00:12:50,130 --> 00:12:53,461
Seriously, I'm so happy to meet you.

129
00:12:55,149 --> 00:12:59,388
This guy has a super low tolerance.
Look, he's barely had any.

130
00:12:59,388 --> 00:13:01,367
No, no, this is normal.

131
00:13:01,367 --> 00:13:04,222
You don't usually drink.

132
00:13:04,222 --> 00:13:07,479
Well, it's a happy occasion,
so once in a while is fine.

133
00:13:07,479 --> 00:13:09,770
- And I'm a little nervous too.
- Nervous?

134
00:13:09,770 --> 00:13:14,510
I mean, this is the Yamane,
the one who finally snagged Ryosuke.

135
00:13:14,510 --> 00:13:16,696
- "The Yamane"?
- Just drink some water.

136
00:13:16,696 --> 00:13:18,224
Why do I have to drink that?

137
00:13:18,224 --> 00:13:21,080
Just drink it. You're drunk.

138
00:13:22,352 --> 00:13:24,722
You two really are close.

139
00:13:24,722 --> 00:13:27,057
Well, being with this guy is easy.

140
00:13:27,057 --> 00:13:30,515
What do you mean "easy"?
I've done so much for you.

141
00:13:30,515 --> 00:13:33,785
Yeah, and I've done the same for you too.

142
00:13:33,785 --> 00:13:35,588
That's right.

143
00:13:35,588 --> 00:13:37,589
Oh, I know!

144
00:13:37,589 --> 00:13:40,444
Want to see some college photos?

145
00:13:40,444 --> 00:13:41,985
Oh?

146
00:13:41,985 --> 00:13:45,285
No, that's fine. She doesn't need to see.

147
00:13:45,285 --> 00:13:48,473
Wait, photos of you in college?

148
00:13:53,121 --> 00:13:55,307
Just show her.

149
00:14:01,219 --> 00:14:04,471
You look kind of young.

150
00:14:09,372 --> 00:14:12,226
But your hair was already black.

151
00:14:12,226 --> 00:14:14,150
Yeah.

152
00:14:14,150 --> 00:14:18,197
I think that's from
our fourth year of college.

153
00:14:18,197 --> 00:14:22,495
I think it was around
when we got assigned to our labs.

154
00:14:22,495 --> 00:14:23,730
Oh, that's right!

155
00:14:23,730 --> 00:14:25,347
During our labs' group trip, he...

156
00:14:25,347 --> 00:14:27,325
Stop! Don't say stupid stuff!

157
00:14:27,325 --> 00:14:29,077
- Why not?
- You don't have to say it!

158
00:14:29,077 --> 00:14:31,257
It's okay if she knows.

159
00:14:32,489 --> 00:14:34,580
Sorry, it's work. I'll be right back.

160
00:14:34,580 --> 00:14:35,800
Okay.

161
00:14:38,595 --> 00:14:41,237
- Take your time.
- Don't say anything stupid.

162
00:14:41,237 --> 00:14:42,782
So scary.

163
00:14:43,793 --> 00:14:45,343
Thank you for that.

164
00:14:45,343 --> 00:14:46,929
Sure.

165
00:14:54,092 --> 00:14:55,659
Hey.

166
00:14:57,129 --> 00:15:01,860
When I called you "the Yamane",
I didn't mean anything weird by it.

167
00:15:01,860 --> 00:15:03,627
Huh?

168
00:15:03,627 --> 00:15:07,709
Back when we were students,
I just happened to hear about you.

169
00:15:08,641 --> 00:15:12,118
Ryosuke is good with people,

170
00:15:12,796 --> 00:15:16,613
but he doesn't really get close to anyone.

171
00:15:17,486 --> 00:15:21,618
He wasn't the type to get attached to anyone.

172
00:15:22,765 --> 00:15:24,151
But...

173
00:15:26,784 --> 00:15:29,574
I'm glad you're a good person.

174
00:15:30,638 --> 00:15:33,020
That's... I'm flattered.

175
00:15:33,020 --> 00:15:36,864
It's my first time
seeing Ryosuke in such a good mood.

176
00:15:37,512 --> 00:15:39,065
Was he in a good mood?

177
00:15:39,065 --> 00:15:41,399
You couldn't tell?

178
00:15:41,399 --> 00:15:42,693
No...

179
00:15:43,519 --> 00:15:46,852
Then he's always like that
in front of you, huh?

180
00:15:51,910 --> 00:15:54,850
But this is my first time

181
00:15:55,972 --> 00:15:58,712
seeing him look so relaxed.

182
00:15:59,892 --> 00:16:03,331
Well, we get along.

183
00:16:03,331 --> 00:16:06,807
He said you were his best friend in college,

184
00:16:06,807 --> 00:16:12,837
so I knew you must be
a very important friend to him.

185
00:16:16,776 --> 00:16:19,351
Huh? Why are you laughing?

186
00:16:23,150 --> 00:16:25,974
He really loves us, huh?

187
00:16:29,804 --> 00:16:31,411
I guess so.

188
00:16:32,696 --> 00:16:34,327
Cheers!

189
00:16:34,327 --> 00:16:35,871
Cheers.

190
00:16:38,549 --> 00:16:41,011
<i>Remember your last client?</i>

191
00:16:41,011 --> 00:16:43,077
Yes, I remember.

192
00:16:43,077 --> 00:16:46,169
<i>We're trying to start another project there.</i>

193
00:16:46,169 --> 00:16:48,409
<i>We want you to come, Taguchi.</i>

194
00:16:49,149 --> 00:16:50,574
Huh?

195
00:16:50,574 --> 00:16:53,287
<i>Well, it's not decided yet, though.</i>

196
00:17:15,553 --> 00:17:17,182
<i>I see.</i>

197
00:17:17,779 --> 00:17:20,946
So it tastes good
because I'm eating with you.

198
00:17:48,901 --> 00:17:50,608
Oh, you're here.

199
00:17:53,135 --> 00:17:54,754
- Ryosuke.
- Yeah?

200
00:17:54,754 --> 00:17:57,798
Looks like they're moving me to Fukuoka.

201
00:17:57,798 --> 00:18:01,110
We'll have to move right away, so be ready.

202
00:18:04,488 --> 00:18:05,761
Huh?

203
00:18:11,495 --> 00:18:13,775
I'm glad

204
00:18:13,775 --> 00:18:15,917
that you get to date Yamane.

205
00:18:18,475 --> 00:18:19,788
Yeah.

206
00:18:21,217 --> 00:18:24,550
But hey, did you tell her the truth?

207
00:18:24,550 --> 00:18:29,271
Like why you said that to Yamane
before you transferred schools.

208
00:18:32,529 --> 00:18:34,110
I didn't.

209
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:37,054
I didn't tell her

210
00:18:38,772 --> 00:18:40,982
and I don't want to.

211
00:18:40,982 --> 00:18:42,302
Huh?

212
00:18:46,072 --> 00:18:48,619
Because I don't want to trouble her.

213
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:58,364
Are you okay now?

214
00:18:58,364 --> 00:18:59,612
Yeah.

215
00:19:00,511 --> 00:19:04,316
But I'm sorry... both you and Inooka.

216
00:19:04,316 --> 00:19:08,297
No, he didn't seem to mind at all.

217
00:19:08,297 --> 00:19:12,659
Well, I'm going to hold off on alcohol
for a while.

218
00:19:12,659 --> 00:19:14,074
I see.

219
00:19:18,371 --> 00:19:20,316
Thanks for walking me home.

220
00:19:20,316 --> 00:19:23,840
Of course. I just wanted to be with you
a little longer.

221
00:19:29,524 --> 00:19:35,753
It was really fun hearing more
about you today, Taguchi.

222
00:19:37,066 --> 00:19:40,530
Inooka is a really good person, too.

223
00:19:44,866 --> 00:19:46,286
What's wrong?

224
00:19:49,120 --> 00:19:52,179
You two are so close.

225
00:19:52,179 --> 00:19:55,070
I got a little jealous.

226
00:19:55,070 --> 00:19:57,923
Huh? Even though we're dating?

227
00:19:59,116 --> 00:20:03,566
I realized there's still so much
I don't know about you.

228
00:20:07,795 --> 00:20:10,177
Well, that goes both ways.

229
00:20:11,081 --> 00:20:12,403
Yeah.

230
00:20:15,214 --> 00:20:20,262
So, I want to know more about you, Taguchi.

231
00:20:23,781 --> 00:20:25,947
I feel the same way.

232
00:20:29,925 --> 00:20:31,686
Thank goodness.

233
00:20:33,678 --> 00:20:35,889
Well, see you tomorrow.

234
00:20:35,889 --> 00:20:38,755
Yeah. See you tomorrow.

235
00:20:51,362 --> 00:20:53,107
Hey...

236
00:20:53,107 --> 00:20:57,942
There was one more thing I was jealous about.

237
00:20:58,588 --> 00:20:59,901
Yeah?

238
00:21:05,413 --> 00:21:07,318
Good night,

239
00:21:08,143 --> 00:21:10,409
Ryosuke.

240
00:21:20,902 --> 00:21:23,794
Huh? Hey, wait a minute!

241
00:21:35,003 --> 00:21:37,312
She got me.

242
00:21:42,962 --> 00:21:45,777
Good morning, Ms. Yamane.

243
00:21:46,682 --> 00:21:48,673
Good morning.

244
00:21:50,551 --> 00:21:52,386
What was that yesterday?

245
00:21:57,164 --> 00:21:59,950
You wanted me to go easy on you, right?

246
00:22:05,295 --> 00:22:08,188
But if you do stuff like that...

247
00:22:11,456 --> 00:22:13,143
Well...

248
00:22:19,673 --> 00:22:21,668
Hey, when is "next time"?

249
00:22:33,642 --> 00:22:35,706
What are you doing?

250
00:22:35,706 --> 00:22:37,923
I bought the wrong one.

251
00:22:38,679 --> 00:22:40,253
Are you feeling tired?

252
00:22:40,985 --> 00:22:42,837
Maybe I'm just mentally exhausted.

253
00:22:42,837 --> 00:22:45,419
You know, with school festival prep.

254
00:22:45,419 --> 00:22:46,859
I see.

255
00:22:47,505 --> 00:22:52,204
But talking with you is really fun.

256
00:23:01,371 --> 00:23:02,885
Hey.

257
00:23:05,191 --> 00:23:06,878
Actually, I...

258
00:23:10,516 --> 00:23:12,029
<i>Yamane!</i>

259
00:23:15,395 --> 00:23:18,128
Is that you, Yamane?

260
00:23:21,767 --> 00:23:23,661
Kashiwagi?

261
00:23:30,645 --> 00:23:33,621
Kashiwagi, you haven't changed at all.

262
00:23:33,621 --> 00:23:36,505
Yamane, you've become really beautiful.

263
00:23:36,505 --> 00:23:38,940
The two of them had a great vibe.

264
00:23:38,940 --> 00:23:41,973
I lied to her for the second time.

265
00:23:41,973 --> 00:23:43,098
Did you two meet?

266
00:23:43,098 --> 00:23:44,339
We haven't met.

267
00:23:44,339 --> 00:23:47,574
I feel like Taguchi has been down lately.

268
00:23:47,574 --> 00:23:50,911
I wonder what I can do
to be more like a girlfriend.

269
00:23:50,911 --> 00:23:53,256
A date at home.

270
00:23:53,256 --> 00:23:55,298
I don't want to let you go home.

271
00:23:55,298 --> 00:24:00,031
I want to do couple-like things
with you, too, Ryosuke.
